      47.85,
      386.77,
      539.99,
      421.84
    ],
    "text": "NOTICE is hereby given in terms of Section 84 of the National Water Supply and Drainage Board Law No. 02 of 1974 thatthe following tariffs will be charged with effect from the 01st day of December 2016, from all the consumers suppliedwith water from the water supply schemes of the National Water Supply and Drainage Board.",
