      378.13,
      432.57,
      389.2
    ],
    "text": "The cost of providing a new service connection will be levied from the consumer.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      78.55,
      402.13,
      529.88,
      425.2
    ],
    "text": "(2) Customers who do not use water at all during a particular month are charged at minimum monthly servicecharge.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      78.55,
      438.13,
      547.25,
      485.2
    ],
    "text": "(3) If a meter is found to be out of order or if it is removed for repairs or calibration, the consumption, of waterduring the time that the meter is not available to record consumption, shall be calculated according to theaverage rate of daily consumption obtained during any two successive readings immediately preceding theremoval of meter or the meter becoming defective.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      78.55,
      498.13,
      313.91,
      509.2
    ],
    "text": "(4) Testing of water meters at the request of consumers:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      97.15,
      522.13,
      547.31,
      569.2
    ],
    "text": "The fee for testing of water meters at the request of the consumers, shall be determined by the General Managerof the National Water Supply and Drainage Board, based on costs incurred for the testing of such meter. If ontesting such meter it is proved that the meter had been over/under registering by more than 2% of the correctconsumption, this fee will be refunded.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      76.15,
      582.13,
      223.2,
      593.2
    ],
    "text": "(5) Incentive for prompt Payment:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      97.15,
      606.13,
      547.19,
      653.2
    ],
    "text": "Consumers paying their water bills by cash within 14 working days from the date of issue of the bill will begiven a rebate of 1.5% on the value of the bill. The customers who pay water bills using credit cards / Debitcards will not be eligible for this rebate. Arrangements are available for consumers to deposit money with theBoard in advance to meet the cost of water bills.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      78.55,
      666.13,
      229.76,
      677.2
    ],
    "text": "(6) Surcharge for delay in Payment:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      97.15,
      690.13,
      547.33,
      725.2
    ],
    "text": "Consumers are expected to pay bills, within a period of 14 days. If consumers fails to settle the water bill withina period of 30 days from the date of issuing a bill, an additional charge of 2.5% per month on the balanceoutstanding shall be made from the date the bill was issued.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 6,
    "bbox": [
      47.37,
      71.17,
      537.81,
      94.38
    ],
    "text": "I fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2016'11'02PART I : SEC. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 02.11.20167A",
    "fonts": [
      "FMAbabldBold",
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      6.300000190734863,
      9.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 6,
    "bbox": [
      71.25,
      100.93,
      251.27,
      112.0
    ],
    "text": "(7) Disconnection of Service connections:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 6,
    "bbox": [
      89.85,
      124.93,
      539.96,
      148.0
    ],
    "text": "The General Manager of the National Water Supply and Drainage Board shall have the power to disconnect theservice connection of consumers, whose bills are in arrears for a period of more than 30 days.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 6,
    "bbox": [
      71.25,
      160.93,
      173.26,
      172.0
    ],
    "text": "(8) Re-Connection Fee:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 6,
    "bbox": [
      89.85,
      184.93,
      539.97,
      208.0
    ],
    "text": "The fee for re-connecting the supply, after the service has been disconnected, shall be determined by the GeneralManager of the National Water Supply and Drainage Board, based on the costs incurred for such re-connection.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 6,
    "bbox": [
      71.25,
      220.93,
      194.26,
      232.0
    ],
    "text": "(9) Violation of Regulations:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 6,
    "bbox": [
      89.85,
      244.93,
      540.0,
      292.0
    ],
    "text": "If any regulation, under which the water supply has been provided, is violated by any consumer, action will betaken under the relevant provisions of the National Water Supply and Drainage Board Law No. 02 of 1974, theNational Water Supply and Drainage Board (Amendment) Act, No. 13 of 1992 or any other subsequentamendment to the legislation.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
