    "text": "Sewerage charge for the relevant month of billing under Domestic tariff, Commercial tariff and Industrial tariffshall be devised on the consumption of water, taking into consideration the utilization of all sources of water supply.Monthly sewerage service charge will be applicable for all premises, even the usage is zero within a particular month.",
